  "contentHtml": "<!--StartFragment-->\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >- </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">홍수 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >-</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp; </P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >2015</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">년 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >10</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">월 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >30</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">일수</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >). </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">아침 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >6</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">시반에 일어나 보니 비가 억수같이 쏟아지고 있었다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">현관 문틈으로 물이 들어와서 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >1</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">층 거실이 물바다가 되었다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">대충 수건으로 바닥의 물을 짜내고 아침을 먹었다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">아침을 먹는데 사이렌이 울렸다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">어디에 토네이도가 나타난 모양이구나</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >.. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">어딘지는 모르겠지만 우리 집은 아니겠지</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >... </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">아파트 앞 도로의 상황은 이랬다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/254124415679FD5D17\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"168-1) 홍수-수정.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"512\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"512\"  id=\"A_254124415679FD5D17855A\"/></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">&nbsp;</P><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">내가 사는 아파트에서 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >35</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">번 고속도로의 반대편의 상황은 더욱 심각하였다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">사진에서 보는 바와 같이 망망대해</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >...</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" ></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2740A6415679FD5D17\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"168-2) 망망대해-수정.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"512\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"512\"  id=\"A_2740A6415679FD5D17219A\"/></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">&nbsp;</P><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">텍사스주립대 가는 길</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">당연히 오늘은 스쿨버스가 다니지 않는다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">학교는 폐쇄</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">오후에 전자기학 수업도 있었는데</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">솔직히 너무 즐겁다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" ></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/263DB3415679FD5E19\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"168-3) 학교가는 길-수정.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"512\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"512\"  id=\"A_263DB3415679FD5E199E95\"/></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">&nbsp;</P><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">골프장</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">오늘같은 날 라운딩을 하면 수중골프가 가능하겠다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" ></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2739C4415679FD5E1C\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"168-4) 골프장-수정.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"512\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"512\"  id=\"A_2739C4415679FD5E1C9BF2\"/></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">&nbsp;</P><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">이 빗속에서도 먹고 살아보겠다고 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >HEB</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">에 갔다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">한참 열심히 장을 보고 있는데</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">갑자기 정전이 되었다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">이후의 모습은 정말 인상적이었다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">우선 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >UPS(Uninterrupted Power Supply: </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">정전대비용 보조 전원 장치</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >)</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">가 작동되는지 실내가 암흑천지로 변하지 않았다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">전기가 나가는 순간</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">내부의 많은 사람들은 순간 동작을 멈췄다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">그리고 조용히 주위를 살폈다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">그리고 잠시 후</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >... </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">그들은 하던 일을 계속 했다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">너무나 차분한 모습</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">안에는 직원들도 있었는데</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">손님들은 그들에게 무슨 일이냐고 묻거나 우왕좌왕하지 않았다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">다만 장 보는 일을 얼른 얼른 정리하더니 신속히 빠져나갔다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" ></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/213C71415679FD601A\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"168-5) 정전-수정.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"512\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"512\"  id=\"A_213C71415679FD601A2DDB\"/></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">&nbsp;</P><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">학교에서</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">그리고 교육청</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >(</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">샌마커스 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >CISD)</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">에서</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">계속 전화가 왔다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">아침에 작은 애를 내려주고 났더니 작은 애의 초등학교에서 애들을 학교에 보내지 않아도 된다는 전화가 왔었는데</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">점심 무렵에는 작은 애가 다니는 트레비스 초등학교가 불어난 물로 인해 고립되었다는 전화가 왔다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">아이들은 트럭을 이용해서 안전한 곳으로 이동시키고 있으니</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">학부모들은 인근의 굿나잇 중학교에 가서 초등학생들을 데려가라고 했다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp; </P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">한 대의 트럭으로 전교생을 굿나잇중학교로 이동시키려니 많은 시간이 걸렸다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">학부모들과 아이들은 이렇게 식당에 모여 있었다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">학부모가 자기 아이를 데려가는 과정도 매우 질서정연하였다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">일단 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >“</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">엄마</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >!!” </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">부르면 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >“</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">철수야</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >!!” </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">하고 데려가는 시스템이 아니었다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">무장한 경찰이 곳곳에서 질서를 유지시키는 가운데 학부모들은 아이를 만나기까지 세 번의 사인을 하고 나서야 비로소 자신의 아이를 만날 수 있었다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" ></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/234387415679FD6016\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"168-6) 굿나잇중학교-수정.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"512\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"512\"  id=\"A_234387415679FD6016EA2A\"/></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">&nbsp;</P><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">아이를 만났지만 아직도 상황은 끝난 것이 아니었다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">비는 그친지 한참 되었지만 도로의 곳곳은 통제되었다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">통제되지 않은 도로에는 자동차들이 넘쳐났다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">인구라고는 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >5</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">만명밖에 안되는 시골동네지만 차 있는 사람들은 다 끌고 나온 것 같았다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">그렇다 보니 평소에 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >10</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">분도 안 걸리는 거리를 오는데 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >3</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">시간이 걸렸다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">차라리 걸어오는 편이 훨씬 빨랐을 것이다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">하지만 미국 사람들이 대단한 것은 이 난리통에도 평소에 하던 대로 질서를 유지한다는 것이다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">이 동네의 많은 사거리에는 원래 신호등이 없다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">단지 정지신호만 있을 뿐이다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">사람들은 사거리에 이르면 일단 정지했다가 먼저 온 순서대로 진행한다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">이는 오늘같은 날도 마찬가지였다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">도로에 차량은 넘쳐났지만 교통경찰은 별로 없었다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">시민들이 스스로 알아서 잘 하는데</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">경찰이 왜 필요하겠는가</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >? </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">그리고 오늘은 경찰차도 올 수 없었을 것이다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" ></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/233DBC415679FD6119\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"168-7) 도로통제-수정.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"512\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"512\"  id=\"A_233DBC415679FD61199EFE\"/></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">&nbsp;</P><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">홍수 다음날</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">햇빛은 쨍쨍했지만 길가의 모습은 이랬다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" ></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2243D7415679FD6314\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"168-8) 홍수이후-수정.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"512\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"512\"  id=\"A_2243D7415679FD631403CA\"/></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">&nbsp;</P><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">흙탕물은 폭포를 이루며 쏟아졌다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2259A2415679FD6405\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"168-9) 흙탕물폭포-수정.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"512\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"512\"  id=\"A_2259A2415679FD6405FF3E\"/></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">&nbsp;</P><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">평소에 내가 가족들과 물놀이를 즐겼던 샌마커스 강은 이렇게 되었다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify\">&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/22531C415679FD6509\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"FLOAT: none; CLEAR: none\" data-filename=\"168-10) 샌마커스강-수정.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"512\" border=\"0\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" width=\"512\"  id=\"A_22531C415679FD6509D584\"/></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">사족</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp; </P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >1) </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">이번 홍수를 경험하며</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">아무 것도 가진 것이 없다는 사실로 인해 때로는 행복할 수도 있음을 알았다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. 1</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">층 거실에 물이 들어와도 걱정할 것이 없었다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">내 집이 아니니까</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">설령 침수되더라도 사무실에서 해결해 주겠지</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >... </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">아님 말고</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">어차피 우리는 한달만 있으면 떠날 사람들이니까</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">지구 멸망의 날처럼 번개가 내리치는데도 걱정할 것이 없었다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">어차피 대부분의 가전제품들은 아파트의 것이다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0>&nbsp; </P>\r\n<P style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=0><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >2) </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">할로윈데이 바로 전날에 물난리가 나는 바람에 올해의 할로윈데이는 시시하게 끝이 났다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >. </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">나의 아이들도 작년에 해봐서 의욕도 없고</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >, </SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">이제는 컸다고 </SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >trick or treat</SPAN><SPAN style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">도 하지 않는다고 했다</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" >.</SPAN></P>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}